# macOS AppleDouble 垃圾
._*
**/._*

# 人工快照/回滚目录与散落调试脚本（不入库）——多人协作时这些会把 git status 淹没
public.new/
public.new.backup-*/
public/admin-vue.backup-*/
public/admin-vue/poc-release-ledger.json
.rollback-snapshots/
.codex-backups/
/e2e_*.js
/run-dev

# dev worktree 里这两个是软链回生产的「文件」，上面 node_modules/ 和 uploads/
# 带斜杠的规则只匹配目录，匹配不到软链，会一直挂在 untracked 里干扰视线
/node_modules
/vue-app/node_modules
/uploads

# P0 catalog history stays outside public releases
/public/leaip0/leai product data.backup-*/
